<% content_for :title, "Privacy · NEET PG Choice Planner" %>
<% content_for :body_class, "landing" %>
<header class="lp-nav">
  <%= link_to "NEET PG Choice Planner", root_path, class: "lp-brand" %>
  <nav><%= link_to "Open planner", planner_path, class: "button primary" %></nav>
</header>

<main class="lp doc">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="lp-lede">NEET PG Choice Planner is a free, independent tool run by <%= link_to "Syed Fazil Basheer", "https://fazzle.dev" %>. This page says what it keeps, why, and how to have it deleted. Last updated <%= Date.new(2026, 10, 21).to_fs(:long) %>.</p>

  <h2>Without signing in</h2>
  <p>Your plan stays in your own browser. Nothing you plan is sent to us.</p>

  <h2>If you sign in</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Your email address</strong>, to send sign-in links and to know which plan is yours.</li>
    <li><strong>Your plan</strong>: the choices you pick, their order and your notes, plus up to 300 earlier versions so you can restore them from History.</li>
    <li><strong>Your signed-in devices</strong>: the browser name and IP address of each sign-in, so a session can be recognised and ended.</li>
    <li><strong>A name and NEET PG roll number</strong>, only if an administrator added you as a student and filled them in.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We use this only to run the planner. We do not sell it, show ads, or use analytics or tracking cookies. The only cookies keep you signed in.</p>

  <h2>Where it is kept and who helps</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The app and its database run on a server in Germany (Hetzner), with backups in Hetzner object storage, also in Germany.</li>
    <li>Sign-in emails are sent through Brevo.</li>
    <li>Fonts load from Google Fonts, which sees your IP address when they load.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>The Chrome extension</h2>
  <p>The extension keeps a copy of your plan in your own browser and reads the MCC choice-filling page only when it is open. It never sees your MCC password, security pin or OTP, and it sends nothing to us or anyone else.</p>

  <h2>ChatGPT, Claude and other assistants</h2>
  <p>If you connect an AI assistant, we keep its name, the address it returns to, when you connected it and when it last used the planner, so you can see it and disconnect it on the <%= link_to "connect page", connect_path %>. It can read the catalog and read and change your plan, nothing else. What you say to the assistant, and the results it gets from the planner, are handled by that assistant's company under its own privacy policy.</p>

  <h2>Deleting your data</h2>
  <p>Email <%= mail_to "hey@fazzle.dev" %> from the address you sign in with and we will delete your account, plan and history within 7 days. Signing out on a device ends that session straight away, and disconnecting an assistant cuts it off straight away.</p>

  <h2>Not affiliated</h2>
  <p>This tool is not run by or connected to the Medical Counselling Committee, NBEMS or the Government of India.</p>
</main>

<footer class="lp-foot">
  <p><%= link_to "Home", root_path %> · <%= link_to "Source on GitHub", "https://github.com/fazzledev/neet-pg-choice-planner", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %></p>
</footer>
